#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:1
msgid "Continuum"
msgstr "连续谱"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:3
msgid ""
"In PySME, the continuum level of the synthetic spectrum can be adjusted "
"to match the observed spectrum using `cscale` and `cscale_flag`."
msgstr "在 PySME 中，可以通过 `cscale` 和 `cscale_flag` 调整合成光谱的连续谱水平，使之与观测光谱匹配。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:5
msgid ""
"`cscale`: Polynomial coefficients (per segment) applied to the synthetic "
"spectrum. The polynomial is evaluated on the observed wavelength grid "
"after shifting the first point to zero, i.e., `f(wave - wave[0])`."
msgstr ""
"`cscale`：施加到合成光谱上的多项式系数（每个 segment 一组）。这个多项式会在观测波长网格上求值，并将首个点平移到零点后再计算，即 "
"`f(wave - wave[0])`。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:7
msgid "`cscale_flag`: Controls whether and how continuum correction is applied."
msgstr "`cscale_flag`：控制是否应用连续谱修正，以及采用哪种方式。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:8
msgid "`none`: No continuum correction."
msgstr "`none`：不做连续谱修正。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:9
msgid "`fix`: Use the current `cscale` values without updating them."
msgstr "`fix`：使用当前的 `cscale` 值，不再更新。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:10
msgid "`constant`: Scale by a constant factor."
msgstr "`constant`：使用常数因子缩放。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:11
msgid "`linear`: First-order polynomial (straight line)."
msgstr "`linear`：一阶多项式（直线）。"

#: ../../fundamentals/continuum.md:12
msgid "`quadratic`: Second-order polynomial."
msgstr "`quadratic`：二阶多项式。"
